Attribution for chat.mjs
=======================

Adapted from prismarine-chat 1.13.0 index.js, MessageBuilder.js and format.js.
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-chat
Uses selected object-only simplify/tag helpers from prismarine-nbt 2.8.0.
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-nbt
The adaptation pins PC 1.21.1, injects registry tables, replaces Buffer UUID
conversion, omits host debug configuration, supports the limited guest console,
and supplies the declared MessageBuilder.fromNetwork helper missing in source.
No Minecraft source has been copied.

Runtime SNBT dependency: mojangson 2.1.0, with nearley 2.20.1's parser runtime.
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/node-mojangson
https://github.com/hardmath123/nearley
The browser bundle includes mojangson/index.js, its generated grammar.js, and
nearley/lib/nearley.js. Nearley's CLI/compiler dependencies are not bundled.

The installed prismarine-nbt and mojangson packages declare MIT but supply no
LICENSE file or separate copyright notice. Their original package declarations
are retained below; no copyright holder or year is invented.

